  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "bt_doc",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -294
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "BODY TRACKING (MediaPipe)\n\nToggle → starts the Camera AND the Landmarks tracker. Each detection gets a STABLE auto colour (the node's `color` / `connColor` outputs), so every person/hand entering the view is a different colour. One ForEach draws a coloured line per edge, another a coloured dot per point.\n\nSwitch the tracker dropdown (hands / face / pose / all) and raise `count` to track more people. Set `person` to 1/2/3 to isolate one.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 230
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "BODY TRACKING (MediaPipe)\n\nToggle → starts the Camera AND the Landmarks tracker. Each detection gets a STABLE auto colour (the node's `color` / `connColor` outputs), so every person/hand entering the view is a different colour. One ForEach draws a coloured line per edge, another a coloured dot per point.\n\nSwitch the tracker dropdown (hands / face / pose / all) and raise `count` to track more people. Set `person` to 1/2/3 to isolate one.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 230
      }
    },
